/// What a booking request asks the venue for (venue-confirmation-and-
/// booking-intents spec, docs/specs/2026-08-27). Picks the form variant and
/// the default event owner: PERFORM → venue owns the minted event (today's
/// flow); RENT / USE → the requester owns it. USE is non-transactional (a
/// meeting, a reading, a movie night) and always produces an event.
enum BookingIntent {
  PERFORM         // pitch a show (existing rows backfill here)
  RENT            // hire a space for a window; space REQUIRED
  USE             // non-transactional use of a space; space REQUIRED
}

/// Per-Calendar rental posture (venue-confirmation-and-booking-intents spec).
/// INSTANT is RESERVED — it gets its own spec, is NOT selectable in any UI,
/// and is mutually exclusive with rental REQUESTS on that calendar
